<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFA buys 35,000 tonnes Argentine wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFA buys 35,000 tonnes Argentine wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Feed Association's (KFA) office in Pusan has bought 35,000 tonnes of Argentine wheat at $141.50 per tonne C&amp;F through private negotiation, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They said the association bought the wheat from South Korean trading house Daewoo Corp with shipment for March 15-April 15.</p>
<p>Arrival was slated by May 25 to the southeastern port city of Pusan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
